<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile receives no manganese ore offers.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile receives no manganese ore offers.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Defense National Stockpile Center said it received no offers for manganese ore.</p>
<p>The next date for receiving offers is April 1.</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1646))</p>
</text>
